<title>UK: UK trade data point to strong exports - Treasury.</title>
<headline>UK trade data point to strong exports - Treasury.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The UK Treasury said trade data published today &quot;demonstrate the strength of export growth.&quot;  </p>
<p>THE DATA SHOWED</p>
<p>---------------</p>
<p>UK JUNE GLOBAL TRADE DEFICIT 1.12 BLN STG,EX-OIL ERRATICS 1.46 BLN STG</p>
<p>UK JUNE EU TRADE DEFICIT 28 MLN STG, GLOBAL TREND FLAT</p>
<p>UK JULY NON-EU TRADE DEFICIT 506 MLN STG, EX-OIL ERRATICS 410 MLN STG</p>
<p>- John Speck, London Newsroom +44 171 542-8663</p>
